and GAD support spaces. The project is essential to ensure a safe, nurturing, and developmentally appropriate environment while promoting holistic and gender-responsive child development.\", \"fund_source\": \"GAA\", \"project_title\": \"Construction of 2-Storey Child Minding Center ΓÇô Sorsogon\", \"funding_category\": \"Tier 1\"}}',NULL,'2026-06-15 17:01:14','2026-06-15 17:01:14'),(53,'project','created','App\\Models\\Project','created',35,'App\\Models\\User',4,'{\"attributes\": {\"status\": \"Ongoing\", \"latitude\": null, \"longtitude\": null, \"description\": \"The construction of the building will provide students with a well-built and functional facility to transact business, and expand office spaces to improve efficiency and comfort for staff. It will include offices, accreditation center, and conference rooms.\", \"fund_source\": \"GAA\", \"project_title\": \"Construction of Academic Building\", \"funding_category\": \"Tier 1\"}}',NULL,'2026-06-15 17:05:30','2026-06-15 17:05:30'),(54,'project','created','App\\Models\\Project','created',36,'App\\Models\\User',4,'{\"attributes\": {\"status\": \"Proposed\", \"latitude\": null, \"longtitude\": null, \"description\": \"The project involves the construction of a new academic building at Castilla Campus, comprising eight classrooms, two offices, and separate male and female comfort rooms. It aims to address rising student enrollment, ease classroom congestion, and provide adequate learning spaces to enhance the overall quality of instruction.\", \"fund_source\": \"GAA\", \"project_title\": \"Construction of two-storey Academic and Technology Building - Castilla Campus\", \"funding_category\": \"Tier 1\"}}',NULL,'2026-06-15 17:07:40','2026-06-15 17:07:40'),(55,'project','created','App\\Models\\Project','created',37,'App\\Models\\User',4,'{\"attributes\": {\"status\": \"Proposed\", \"latitude\": null, \"longtitude\": null, \"description\": \"The project involves the installation of on-grid solar photovoltaic (PV) systems at the SorSUΓÇôSorsogon City Campus to improve energy efficiency and reduce electricity consumption. It will cover major campus buildings and support the use of renewable energy. The project is essential to lower operational costs and promote sustainable, climate-friendly practices.\", \"fund_source\": \"GAA\", \"project_title\": \"Green Campus Project: Installation of On-Grid Solar Photovoltaic System at Sorsogon State University-Sorsogon City Campus\", \"funding_category\": \"Tier 1\"}}',NULL,'2026-06-15 17:11:10','2026-06-15 17:11:10');
